                <h2>Who We Are</h2>

                <p>

                    Sweet Crumbs Bakery is a proudly family-owned bakery
                    located in Johannesburg, South Africa.

                    Established in 2018, we began as a small home bakery
                    with one goal: creating delicious baked goods using
                    quality ingredients and traditional baking methods.

                </p>

                <p>

                    Today, we proudly serve families, schools,
                    businesses and event organisers throughout
                    Johannesburg with artisan breads, pastries,
                    cupcakes, celebration cakes and customised desserts.

                </p>

                <p>

                    Every recipe is carefully prepared using premium
                    ingredients, ensuring freshness, flavour and
                    beautiful presentation every single day.

                </p>

